## Consensus & sync fixes

- `_propose_block` refactored into a seven-phase pipeline (`24b6c88660` +
  `6f27f25e8a` + `b9c855f5c7` + `69ef77460c`): early gates → resolve head →
  collect txs → assemble block → consensus gates → broadcast. CC drops from
  ~88 to ~7, under the C901 threshold.
- Proposer watchdog (`227bb9e105`): `_propose_block_with_watchdog` logs error
  + `poa_proposer_stalled_iterations_total` after `max(60s, 4×interval)`.
- Per-phase tracing (`87e11d7118`): each phase logs start and duration.
- Proposer round timeout aligned to heartbeat (`e8e9a91b04`).
- `_process_txs_parallel` write-phase rollback (`a7dd35c85a`).
- `fetch_blocks_range` exception logging improved (`7839be1bbc`): error
  details in log message, not just `extra` dict.
- `_parallel_bulk_import` documented as disabled-by-design (`7839be1bbc`).
- `AITBC_HOSTNAME` env intermediate before `socket.gethostname()` fallback
  (`7839be1bbc`).
- `get_block` includes `block_metadata` for multi-validator signature
  validation (`a2d22d4597`).
- `get_state_delta` returns empty diff when state roots match (`a2d22d4597`).
- SyncManager gossip disabled when proposer id or key missing (`5ea965e1d8`,
  `ba1f10499`).
- Non-block messages filtered in SyncManager gossip consumer (`856c5bfc22`).
- Duplicate Account inserts avoided in delta sync (`2926376d0b`).

